    "text": "13 hours ago BELMONT, N.H. – Friends, colleagues and the community are remembering Earl Sweeny following news of his passing. Sweeney, 88 who passed away over the weekend, began his career in Law Enforcement in 1957 as a Patrol Officer in Belmont and in 1961 he became the State’s youngest Police Chief at age 24. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
